// Campaign opening (docs/STORY.md §5). Times in seconds, offsets in metres from the anchor.
// `from`/`to`: camera relative to the look point at shot start/end. Shots with a `group` are
// reordered per species: the captain's own civilisation speaks first. Checked by
// `cargo test -p view --test cinematic` (anchors exist, captions fit and can be read in time).
(
    name: "opening",
    order: [
        (Human, ["record", "memory", "contract"]),
        (Veyr, ["memory", "record", "contract"]),
        (Kharz, ["contract", "record", "memory"]),
    ],
    shots: [
        (
            id: "gate_far",
